@@ -1,12 +0,0 @@
--- The approved "payment_receipt" WhatsApp template actually has 8 body
--- variables (confirmed in WhatsApp Manager), not the 5 the Receipt Agent
--- code originally assumed — it includes Plan Amount and Remaining Amount
--- alongside the amount actually paid this time. Those two numbers are
--- computed client-side when the receipt image is generated
--- (lib/utils/receipt-generator.ts) but were never persisted, so the Agent
--- tab's worklist (lib/agent/queries.ts) had no way to rebuild them for the
--- default/auto-computed template vars. Persist them on the receipt row.
-
-alter table public.receipts
-  add column if not exists plan_amount numeric,
-  add column if not exists remaining_amount numeric;
